  "text": "[confident] Hi, if you are new here, my name is Chris.\n\nI have worked in data engineering for more than 10 years.\n\nI have interviewed more than 200 engineers, for companies in healthcare, banking, automotive, and financial exchanges. So I know exactly what gets people hired... and what gets them rejected.\n\nI have also sat on the other side of the table, with offers from multiple big tech companies at the same time.\n\nToday, I run Stackle, your career lab, where I teach data engineering and AI engineering.\n\nMore than 13,000 people follow me on LinkedIn. Nearly 4,000 are part of our Meetup community. And one free Claude workshop brought in more than 500 people.\n\nOn this channel, I teach you the skills that actually get you hired. No fluff. Just what works.\n\n[excited] So let's get into it.",
